Description: |
  Storage-node wrapper: opens and exposes one lib/storage.Storage instance to the rest of the
  process (and, optionally, to a networked vmselect). Sourced by direct reading of main.go,
  vmstorage.go, vmstorage_with_tenant_id.go, and by grepping app/victoria-metrics/main.go to
  confirm this cell is consumed as a library rather than built as its own package main in this
  pinned commit.
